OL,3,GNEWSAShadow health minister quits
OL,4,ABadenoch's top team
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe shadow health secretary Stuart
OL,7,FAndrew has quit Kemi Badenoch's
OL,8,FConservative frontbench team in a week
OL,9,Fthat has seen two other high-profile
OL,10,Fpoliticians - Dame Priti Patel and Sir
OL,11,FJames Cleverley - also resign from the
OL,12,Fshadow cabinet.
OL,14,FAndrew, MP for Daventry in
OL,15,FNorthamptonshire, announced the news on
OL,16,FX and said he would focus on
OL,17,Fconstituency work.
OL,19,FHe held ministerial posts between 2017
OL,20,Fand 2024 and became shadow secretary of
OL,21,Fstate for health and social care in
OL,22,FJuly 2025.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
