OL,3,GNEWSAShadow health minister quits
OL,4,ABadenoch's top team
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It has been a privilege to serve in
OL,7,Fnumerous roles... and I am so grateful
OL,8,Ffor all the support I have received
OL,9,Fpersonally from colleagues, my shadow
OL,10,Fhealth team and my constituency team,"
OL,11,Fhe said.
